# TAB - Transfer A to B (opcode 0x16)

---
name: transfers A to B
memory: 16
setup: a=42 b=11
expect: b=42 N=0 Z=0 V=0
cycles: 1

---
name: transfers negative value
memory: 16
setup: a=80 b=11
expect: b=80 N=1 Z=0 V=0
cycles: 1

---
name: transfers zero
memory: 16
setup: a=00 b=11
expect: b=00 Z=1 N=0 V=0
cycles: 1
